WEBVTT

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.940
Am I...a woman?

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.080
W-What is she talking about?

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.240
Ever since that moment...

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:58.400
it seems there's
been a change in my life.

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:06.840
If I were
to describe it.

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:12.780
I'd say that the ladies
are beginning to notice me.

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:15.120
Whatcha lookin' at?

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.830
Nothing. Only that the
school festival's almost here...

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:22.050
So what? You hungry?
Let's grab a bite.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.240
T-There's that Feeling!

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.240
But I can't believe
it's happening here!

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:00.050
Godai, you've
been actin' weird!

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.460
It's nothing. Nothing at all.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.210
Let's get that food.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.730
Yusaku Godai.

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:18.610
He'll do fine.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:23.920
He never stops--

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:27.400
Excuse me.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.300
You're feelin' like
you're bein' watched?

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.450
Like it's burning
into my back.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:57.180
The C.I.A.?
The K.G.B.?

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.180
Aliens, maybe? I know,
you've got a poltergeist!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.430
Don't treat me
like I'm paranoid!

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:04.740
Calm down.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.210
It's just...

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:08.180
The one staring is...

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.760
I get the feeling
it's a girl--

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:13.960
Why didn't you say so?

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:20.190
Here.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.040
What's this?

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:26.780
I treasured it in the hope
I might use it.

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:30.100
But to prove my friendship,
It's yours.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:34.630
I-It's a--!
Sakamoto!

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:38.030
Grit your teeth
and use it.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.890
Don't waste a friend's gift.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.540
I'm not THAT hard up!

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.660
Geez!

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.650
''Massages.
Only 1900 yen until 7 PM.''

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.150
That's affordable!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.290
Godai--

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.700
T-That Feeling!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.390
A-And you are...?

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.130
Say there, Godai.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.080
Y-Yes?

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:12.940
I don't suppose
you'd accompany me?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:14.210
Yes?

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:18.140
I've had my eye on
you for quite a while.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.090
Well?

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:28.220
Okayama! I've got two hours free.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:29.790
--Then let's go.
--O-Okayama.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:50.210
So, where are we going?

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.850
Follow me and you'll see.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:05.890
If a lady lures a man into
a deserted spot, it means--

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:11.880
Love at first sight.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.460
I can't help it.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.310
This may be a shock,
but I love another.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.770
That has nothing
to do with it.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:30.290
Don't tempt me.

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:35.010
You mustn't make
a woman beg!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.730
Perhaps a single kiss--

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:44.040
Here you go.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.030
W-What's this?

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:50.080
It's called a
brush and a bucket.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:53.710
We're short on labour.
Help us out?

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:58.470
The school festival is coming up.
You haven't joined a club, right?

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.870
I've had my eye on
you for quite a while.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:04.020
I've picked up a nice guy.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.330
This is Godai
our new helper.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:09.830
Thanks!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.150
You're a godsend.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:14.280
Not at all. I've got two hours free.

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:18.440
Is this a sign?

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.140
A backdrop.

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:24.030
''Now I've got you!''

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.910
''Welcome, Mr. New Club Member!''

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.690
Godai's just helping out.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.010
Just helping out?

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.160
Y-Yeah--

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:48.400
''Oh, golly! You're gonna
have to join the club for real!''

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.270
You've got nothing
better to do. Join up.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.980
B-But I--

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:56.900
''Please join up!
I'm so lonely on my own!''

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.440
''Please?
Pretty please!?''

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.060
No, I--

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:04.210
You've got ''puppeteer''
written all over your face.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.320
T-Think so?

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.560
--Please do it!
--Join the club!

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:10.330
O-Okayama.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:15.210
''Hurrah!
Banzai! Banzai!''

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:20.150
''Li'l Masumi is so happy!
Whoopie!''

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:34.840
Here you go!

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.440
Soichiro, here's your breakfast.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.140
Stop it!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:40.170
Brush your teeth,
will ya!?
Stop it!

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.980
Brush your teeth,
will ya!?

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:43.980
You're tickling me!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.670
Godai's steppin' out
with the girls.

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:49.040
Why do you say that?

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:52.170
Look at how late he's
been coming home recently.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:55.680
These days,
coeds like the night life.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:57.650
You don't say.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:02.490
He's a college man now.
Maybe now he's got the guts to get a girl.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.220
Mrs. Ichinose, be careful with
your potato chip crumbs!

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.740
Whoops.
Hit a nerve.

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:14.230
And stop dragging
Godai into everything!

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:17.700
Honestly!

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:27.230
I wonder if she was
referring to...her?

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.760
Hello, Maison Ikkoku.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.020
This is Kuroki.

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:47.730
Yes?

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.160
Is Godai' there?

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.030
Just a moment.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:01.410
Is it that girl? The voice
doesn't seem the same.

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:13.470
Godai?

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.120
Thanks for the invite.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.780
Not at all.
My pleasure.

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:25.480
Tomorrow at five?
See ya then.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.740
''Kuroki!
What's wrong?''

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:34.640
Godai's manager.
She sounds like a young woman.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:38.270
''Oh, no! Godai and some lady
are shacking up!?''

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.820
His manager.
His manager.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:44.440
''But they're
LIVING TOGETHER!''

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:45.860
What's the story?

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:47.520
Sounds like fun!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.000
Thank you.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:52.980
You're welcome.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:10:59.820
Hello, Maison Ikkoku.

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:02.640
I'm Kamisaka.
Can I speak to Godai'?

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.780
For you. It's a girl.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.890
O-Okayama. Thanks.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.770
Hello?
Oh, Kamisaka?

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:18.490
An hour earlier?
Then four o'clock--

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:20.570
Yeah.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:23.560
Okay.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.640
I'm sorry to
tie up the phone.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:29.310
It's all right.
It's all part of the job.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.880
I-I'll bring it to you.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:35.800
Here.

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:37.300
Thank you.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.390
Maison Ikkoku.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:43.430
Hi!
Gimme Yusaku, okay?

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.370
It's another girl.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:54.250
T-Thank you.

00:11:56.010 --> 00:12:01.070
Hello? Koizumi?
Yeah, Kamisaka already told me--

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:04.350
See you.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.490
S-Sorry 'bout all
the phone calls--

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.890
It's all right.
It's all part of the job.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.180
Yeah, but--

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:16.470
You just have so many
female friends, don't you?

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.140
No, actually I--

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:22.560
Hello!?
Maison Ikkoku!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:25.800
This is Nanao.
Could I speak to Godai?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.650
Hello?

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:30.660
Hello?

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:33.730
Hello?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.180
Just hold on for a moment.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:40.820
It's you-know-who.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.790
This is Godai--

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.320
Whatcha calling for?

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:50.650
You want to talk?

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:58.170
This isn't
the best place--

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.280
Okay.
I'll go meet you.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:14.170
I-I'm sorry. Getting calls,
one right after the other.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:17.150
It doesn't matter.
It IS my job.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.820
Explaining it now
wouldn't do any good.

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:26.520
Well-- I really am sorry.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.500
Don't mention it.

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.070
Why that little...

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:44.630
...gigolo!!

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:52.160
Actually, I hadn't
quite left yet.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.550
Ma! I wanna go
to the coffee shop!

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:11.810
Can't afford such luxuries.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:14.300
She just wants me
to carry her stuff!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.740
-- You're right.
-- Really!?

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:29.760
A parfait sounds good.
So does pudding.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:33.030
'Course with the ''Special Parfait''
you get both...

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:37.360
Order whatever you want,
just keep your voice down!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.780
That's the new girlfriend.
So he's given up on the manager!

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:45.240
Who was the lady on the phone?

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.410
My manager. Remember, we met her
on the way to the movie.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.850
Oh, her?
You're kidding!

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:53.500
Ma, whatcha doing?

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:57.160
Will you shut up?
I can't hear a thing!

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.560
So the two of you
are living together.

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:02.920
Well, yes, in a
manner of speaking.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.470
Isn't that kind
of hard on you?

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:07.230
I-- guess--

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:08.740
I'll bet it is.

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:10.350
Well, you know...

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:12.670
You don't know
the half of it.

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.390
Well, I guess it would be.
She's so beautiful. So stylish.

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:30.250
W-What's wrong?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:31.740
I'm sorry.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.390
--I think he's dumping her!
--He's to blame,I'm sure!

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:38.820
Looks like a lovers spat.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:41.510
That's Godai!

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:41.520
Hey! This isn't
for innocent eyes.
That's Godai!

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.430
Hey! This isn't
for innocent eyes.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.110
Why not?

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.110
I can't find--

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:48.540
A handkerchief?

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.970
--Here.
--T-Thank you...

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:54.670
Let's leave.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:05.160
And to think I almost missed it!

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:14.480
Just the mention of
Kyoko starts her crying.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:19.670
That means she realizes
that I'm in love with Kyoko.

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:24.810
She must really be in love.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:32.810
Hold my bag for a second.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:38.470
That hurt. I hate that.
Look how I was crying.

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.430
What hurt?

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.980
When something gets under
your contacts, it really hurts.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.340
C-Contacts!?

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.700
I'm sorry, did I surprise you?

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.020
Y-Y-You sure did!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:54.910
See?

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.140
Look, Soichiro
you want half of my cookie?

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:00.560
Catch me if you can!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.080
A lovers' quarrel!?

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:09.010
I saw the whole thing!
By accident, of course.

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:14.130
Then he put on the gentleman act,
wiping away her tears.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.950
So they made up.
How wonderful for them.

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:22.070
You're a real piece
of work, ain't ya?

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:24.050
Whatever do you mean?

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:26.650
Keep acting cold and
you'll lose your man.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.940
Godai is free to go out
with whomever he pleases.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.040
You don't care?

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:33.910
Not in the slightest.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.090
Gotcha. See ya.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.570
Won't you have
a slice of apple?

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.780
Doesn't look like
there's any left to eat.

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:46.430
Take it easy, huh?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.210
There's plenty to eat!

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:58.960
You saw it?
Mrs. Ichinose, too?

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:00.160
Saw it all!

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:02.660
S-She wouldn't have
told the manager--?

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:06.090
Could she resist
something so juicy?

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.650
Ma called it
a ''lovers' quarrel.''

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:10.750
I knew it!

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:14.840
A lovers quarrel!? Her pure image
of me will crumble!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.680
You were never pure.
Give up.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.720
C'mon. Drown your sorrows.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.150
This isn't funny!
It's all a misunderstanding!!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.900
M-Manager--

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:33.010
Mr. Godai.
Telephone.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:34.190
O-Okay.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.070
Did Mrs. Ichinose
say anything?

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:38.170
About what?

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:40.660
It's not worth talking
about, if she didn't.

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:49.050
I haven't heard a thing.
Not a thing.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.100
R-Really?

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.340
''So, how's the manager taking it?''

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.080
More calmly
than I expected.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:06.440
--That's no fun!
--l wanna call him next!

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:08.250
Godai?

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:09.850
Kuroki?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.960
Now?
Sorry, I can't.

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:14.850
Bye.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.780
Listen, these girls
who've been calling--

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:20.620
Hello.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.400
Godai!

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:24.890
Thanks.

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.890
K-Koizumi?
Sorry, but I can't.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:29.750
That was--

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:32.680
Yes!

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.720
K-Kamisaka?
I'll call you later!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.750
Actually I--

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:46.100
Maison Ikkoku;
WHAT!?

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:49.260
''Hello.
This is Li''l Masumi'. ''

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.500
''Thank you so much
For the call. ''

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.070
''Li''l Masumi'
is all by her lonesome. ''

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.640
''Hello?''

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:58.060
''Hello?''

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:05.170
''Hello, my little Godai'!
Can you come out and play--?''

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:11.480
A-Actually,
all these girls--

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:13.640
The last was a guy, but--

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:17.210
Unless you have more calls,
would you please leave?

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:42.150
So then, several
days later...

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:52.850
...they came to
install a pink payphone.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:58.310
From now on, please ask
your friends to call this number.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:20:59.820
I-I'm sorry.

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.450
It's all my fault--

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:05.010
Actually, I've been meaning to
install one for some time now.

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:08.440
And I'm sure there are phone calls
you'd like to be private.

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.560
Not at all!
I've got nothing to hide!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.620
And I've got nothing
to do with those girls.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.580
What you're doing with those girls
has nothing to do with me!

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:22.790
''Doing with those girls''?
I knew you were taking this wrong!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.040
How am I taking
WHAT wrong?

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.670
Y-You just don't
get it, do you!?

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:32.610
Well, I guess I'm just
some stubborn widow!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.600
W-Wait! If you'd
just listen a second--

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:45.010
If I didn't know better
I'd say that was a lovers' quarrel.

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:52.810
''I'm taking this wrong''!

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:54.470
''Just listen a second''!

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:56.940
So Godai is
THAT kind of man!

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:01.870
And that'll be For Godai, too!

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:04.340
Well, I'm not getting it!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.780
Oh, shut up!

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:23.180
Hello?

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:25.740
It's me.
Please don't hang up.

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:27.560
Godai!

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:31.570
I joined a club
at my college.

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:35.150
Every time those girls called,
it was on club business.

00:22:40.600 --> 00:22:43.930
Koizumi always cries
when she gets drunk.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:49.950
Kamisaka was the one laughing.
They're also in the puppet club.

00:22:51.610 --> 00:22:55.940
The president's name is Saotome.
He's a really nice guy.

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:05.580
Hey, Ma, when's supper?

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:07.910
It's just gettin' good.

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:13.090
I should have told you about
the club right from the start.

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:17.710
And...
One more thing...

00:23:18.640 --> 00:23:20.830
The reason Kozue was
crying in the coffee shop--

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:28.040
Hello?

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:30.700
Are you...still there?

00:23:41.650 --> 00:23:42.300
Yes.

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:52.090
Next week, it will be one year
since I came to Maison Ikkoku.

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:54.900
They want to throw
me a party, but...

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:58.660
Next: ''Way to Go, Godai!
The First Date with Kyoko.''

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:01.140
Oh, Godai.
I'm so sorry!

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:03.130
I got the date and
party all mixed up.

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:04.840
It's all my fault!
